The replacement still hasn’t returned immediately, so the direct specialized `h^3` expansion is also too heavy at this size. I’m going one level lighter: use the exact truncated `x^k` coefficient as the gate and avoid full-degree expansion.
diff --git a/box/strata-rerun-20260903/strata_rerun.py b/box/strata-rerun-20260903/strata_rerun.py
