+
+## Manifest
+
+MEASURED.  The manifest was generated mechanically from
+`xmodel/strata-rerun-corrected-gpt55-20260903.run.v2` by pairing the
+`charged_input_<i>_sha256=` and `charged_input_<i>_basename=` lines, then
