+    text = f"""# Corrected symbolic partition-strata rerun
+
+Lane: `strata-rerun-corrected-gpt55-20260903`.  Inputs: `/tmp/jc2-lane.S2kb7J/inputs`.
+Drivers/results: `box/strata-rerun-20260903/`.
+
+## Manifest
